Subject: [PATCH] config: make split kernel module BTF selectable

OpenWrt shares the packaged modules between the regular and initramfs
kernels. These kernels have different base BTF, so a board can select
vmlinux BTF without encoding a dependency into the shared module set.

--- a/config/Config-kernel.in
+++ b/config/Config-kernel.in
@@ -576,7 +576,8 @@ config KERNEL_DEBUG_INFO_BTF
 	  Required to run BPF CO-RE applications.
 
 config KERNEL_DEBUG_INFO_BTF_MODULES
-	def_bool y
+	bool "Generate split BTF for kernel modules"
+	default y
 	depends on KERNEL_DEBUG_INFO_BTF
 
 config KERNEL_MODULE_ALLOW_BTF_MISMATCH
